Date: Mon, 22 Sep 2025 08:49:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 111/190] dt-bindings: iio: adc: versal-sysmon: Add missing
 additionalProperties

commit db3412af7ab040f3d6d222cf218be91f99385d9a from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Add missing additionalProperties for temperature nodes and also
add missing newline in front of temp node description.

Signed-off-by: Michal Simek <michal.simek@amd.com>
State: pending
Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/iio/adc/xlnx,versal-sysmon.yaml        | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/adc/xlnx,versal-sysmon.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/adc/xlnx,versal-sysmon.yaml
index 6c4337afd095..b51c5d7dafc5 100644
